==Icelandic==
{{cardinalbox|is|17|18|19|sautján|nítján|ord=átjándi}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|is|áttján}} {{q|archaic}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|is|non|átján}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*ahtōutehun}}. Cognate with the {{cog|sv|arton}}, {{cog|da|atten}}, {{cog|en|eighteen}} and {{cog|de|achtzehn}}.

===Numeral===
{{head|is|numeral}}

# '''[[eighteen]]'''; the cardinal number after [[sautján#Icelandic|sautján]] and before [[nítján#Icelandic|nítján]].

====Derived terms====
* {{l|is|einn af átján}}
* {{l|is|nú tekur átján yfir}}, {{l|is|nú kastar átján yfir}}
* {{l|is|sjá upp á átján augum}}

====Related terms====
* (''ordinal form'') {{l|is|átjándi}} {{g|m}}, {{l|is|átjánda}} {{g|f|n}}

